Package: libdtk-qt6-1.7
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Inria dtk scientific platform (Qt6 fork) - runtime libraries
 dtk is a metaplatform of scientific development from Inria, providing a
 modular architecture of core, math, GUI and VR support layers used by
 applications such as medInria.
 .
 This Qt6 fork tracks upstream dtk 1.7.1 ported to the Qt6 / VTK 9.5 stack.
 .
 This package provides the shared runtime libraries.

Package: libdtk-qt6-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libdtk-qt6-1.7 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 qt6-base-dev,
Description: Inria dtk scientific platform (Qt6 fork) - development files
 dtk is a metaplatform of scientific development from Inria, providing a
 modular architecture of core, math, GUI and VR support layers used by
 applications such as medInria.
 .
 This package provides the headers and CMake configuration (the dtk CMake
 package, found via dtk_DIR) needed to build against dtk-qt6.
